                                "sense_id": "73b50f76-ee1e-3bf7-b34f-176b6039cf5d",
                                "text": "O noble sir,\nYour over-kindness doth wring tears from me!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "62fe6e9b-ce87-46e7-8175-acda8a5f4ec6",
                                "sense_id": "73b50f76-ee1e-3bf7-b34f-176b6039cf5d",
                                "text": "The pony stepped out at an invariable ten-mile-an-hour trot. The breeze raised by the motion tempered the overkindness of the sun […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ab51b16-dedd-4ca7-a324-d525783a5e50",
                                "sense_id": "73b50f76-ee1e-3bf7-b34f-176b6039cf5d",
                                "text": "He had no intention of enduring this smothering by overkindness any longer than it took him to figure out how to run away, and where to run to."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
